findings.description:
F-02 from the M173 self-review was filed because the AC-02 verification text read 'mp install --skills=mp-planner' instead of 'mp install --agents=mp-planner'. The runner resolved the finding with status=fixed and fixed_in=milestone:173, but the underlying text was never updated.

 Current state of master-plan/milestones/173-...json AC-02 (verified by {
  "acceptance_criteria": {
    "AC-02": {
      "description": "A dedicated mp-planner agent is installable via `mp install --agents=mp-planner`; the agent file lands at ~/.agents/agents/mp-planner.md (or harness-equivalent path) with a read-only mp command set and the 'planning' role.",
      "evidence": "All 8 steps done; 9 ACs stamped with evidence; cargo fmt + clippy clean; cargo nextest: 2532/2532 pass (3 skip); mp validate: 0 errors exit 0; B-80 resolved (milestone:173); 2 self-findings filed + resolved (low severity) [skip-verify: AC and step verifications skipped]",
      "id": "AC-02",
      "status": "passed",
      "verification": "manual: after M173 S2 lands, 'mp install --skills=mp-planner' deploys ~/.agents/agents/mp-planner.md (or harness-equivalent path); 'cat ~/.agents/agents/mp-planner.md | head -5' shows the agent file content; cargo nextest run -p mp -E 'test(/install_deploys_mp_planner_agent/)' --no-fail-fast exits 0"
    }
  }
}):
 - description: '... mp install --agents=mp-planner ...'  [correct, was updated]
 - verification: '... mp install --skills=mp-planner ...'  [STILL WRONG]

 Reproducer:
   mp show milestone 173 --fields 'acceptance_criteria[AC-02].verification'

 The AC-02 description now uses --agents but the verification field, which a future agent will copy/paste to verify the AC, still instructs --skills. The verification field should read '--agents=mp-planner' to match the description. This is the L9 lesson (new code/spec inheriting pre-existing bugs) in the spec itself — the runner 'fixed' the symptom on the description but left the verification text stale.

 Recommended: re-open F-02 (or file this finding as the closure's regression) and update only the verification field of AC-02 in master-plan/milestones/173-...json.
